impossible to hit and had to somehow be outsmarted or defeated in 
another way. Consumed by a purple worm, for example. If she "finds you 
very attractive" and you don't resist then something bad happens (you 
lose a level?). If you resist enough, she'll eventually just try to 
bribe you with the quest artifact or bell ("Here, this token will 
